\\cdot 3=-1-6=-7.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(D)) & =|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =|\\,-7\\,|\\cdot 12 \\\\  & =84.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074295/state.json" "file_sha256" "0230c5cd9a09b8904f1b2c15dee2388f14093a615d338b631e46f56699184913"} {"question" "q-316580" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074295/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2542092add11252b01c06274e86f35d2768e6a54f7881faf3f8c8a02ea500d9d"} {"question" "q-316580" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074295/state.json" "file_sha256" "0230c5cd9a09b8904f1b2c15dee2388f14093a615d338b631e46f56699184913"} {"question" "q-316580" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "84"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074295/state.json" "file_sha256" "0230c5cd9a09b8904f1b2c15dee2388f14093a615d338b631e46f56699184913"} {"question" "q-316600" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The unit square $D$ has vertices $(1,0),(0,0),(0,1),(1,1).$ What is the area of the image of $D$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ with the standard matrix $T,$ given below?\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n$\\text{Area}(T(D))=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14074295/state.json" "file_sha256" "0230c5cd9a09b8904f1b2c15dee2388f14093a615d338b631e46f56699184913